Z||000000||Brandon86SE||10-15-2001||02:04 AM||||Wow!  I just got back today from the most amazing weekend!  My best friend, Kyle moved to St. Albert from Fort McMurray (where we met 4 years ago) about a month ago, and I finally made it up to see him!  It's really nice to have your best friend only 3 hours away, as opposed to 10, but anyway, I went up for the weekend and had just an amazing time!<P>Friday I left a bit late because of some car problems, (see my post in tech.), but still made it up by 5.  A couple days before my trip I called up a REALLY old friend.  I used to live in Spruce Grove (1986-1991, 'till halfway through grade 3)  Anyway, I had my elementary school sweetheart and I haven't seen, or talked to her in like 8 years!  Out of the blue I called her up on Wednesday, told her I was gonna be in town for the weekend, and we met up Friday night!  Here's a pic of the two of us:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Me_and_Kirstin_2_(small).jpg"> <P>Haven't seen her for 8 years, but still gorgeous!  So Friday night was great!<P>Saturday I went and hung out at West Ed Mall for a bit, and then went over to an old friend from Fort Mac's house (who I haven't seen in over 3 years!).  She didn't even recognize me!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  But there were a bunch of people meeting up at her place, then we all went out to a bar called Rum Jungle, it was a great bar, and I had a great time!<P>Then I had to leave this morning, 'cause Kyle had to work at noon.  On the drive home some guy in a big truck gave me a thumbs up!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I love it when people love my car!  It was the perfect ending to an awesome weekend!<P>I know, this is really off-topic, but I had fun and wanted to share!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||FLASHY||10-15-2001||03:11 AM||||Wow, no doubt you had a great time! I wouldn't mind having that many good things happen to me in one weekend! Keep it up by having a great week too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>See ya next meeting...if it's not snowing by then.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spinsig3.gif"> ||||reg||14
